ain why bran  first heard the wind moving through the  trees the day john found ghost  when bran looks out through the weirwood  this is what happens  lord eddard stark set upon a rock beside  the deep black pole and the godswood  the pale roots of the heart tree  twisting around him like an  old man's gnarled arms the great sword  ice lay across lord edward's lap  and he was cleaning the blade with an  oil cloth winterfell  brain whispered his father looked up  who's there  he asked turning this actually makes  brain afraid  everything begins to fade away and bran  finds himself  back in bloodraven's cave bran says the  bloodraven  he heard me but bloodraven says  something that sounds very familiar to  what bran heard the day jon finds ghost  bloodraven says he heard a whisper on  the wind  a rustling amongst the leaves ned  obviously heard something because he did  give a reaction to bran whispering  winterfell  now whether ned heard bran or the wind  is up for debate  but i think bloodraven is lying to bran  i happen to believe  ned did hear his voice but bloodraven  doesn't want bran to know that  because he doesn't want bran to have  major influences on different events  we even saw something like this happen  in the tv show  we'll visit again another time i want to  see where he's going time to go  father  now did you happen to see the look on  bloodraven's face when that happened  he says ned did not hear bran but why  does he look so afraid when that  happened  now obviously i don't want to mix up  things from the show  and things from the books but maybe this  was included because they may have  intended to take things in a different  direction at first  maybe they wanted to reveal other things  about brain's influence in the weirwood  net but ultimately decided to go in  another direction  either way ned heard something in the  books as he did in the tv show  when bran whispers to his father ned has  an immediate reaction  so maybe bran attempted to do the same  thing when jon found ghost  maybe there will be a scene in the books  where brain is looking back on that day  and when he notices john try to leave  before he finds ghost  he will whisper something to make jon go  back and look again  let me show you something else that is  interesting from the books because there  are more scenes of brian speaking  through the weirwood  one of these scenes he just so happens  to try to speak to john  in this chapter john is out beyond the  wall when he is with the half hand  as they were out here they stopped for  the night to get some sleep  however when jon goes to sleep he thinks  he's having a dream  but what actually happens is jon slips  inside ghost  jon is inside of ghost looking out his  eyes  this is what happens when he finds a  weirwood john  the call came from behind him softer  than a whisper  but strong too can a shout be silent  he turned his head searching for his  brother for a glimpse of a lean gray  shape moving beneath the trees but there  was nothing  only a weirwood the weirwood had his  brother's face  had his brother always had three eyes  not always  came the silent shout not before the  crow  remember this right here john hears  someone whisper his name  and he thinks it was his brother bran  now we know bran is attempting to speak  through the trees over and over again  this may not be the first time bran  tries to speak to jon either  i want to show you another interesting  example this time bran tries to speak to  theon greyjoy  when he is still in winterfell with the  boltons in this chapter  theon is outside in the godswood in  front of the weirwood  this is what it says theon a voice  seemed to whisper  his head snapped up who said that all he  could see were the trees and the fog  that covered them  the voice had been as faint as rustling  leaves a leaf drifted down from above  brushed his brow and landed in the pool  it floated on the water  red five-fingered like a bloody hand  bran  the tree murmured this is exactly what  bloodraven tried to say  ned heard when brain attempted to speak  to him bloodraven said all he would have  heard was the wind and rustling leaves  but we know these whispers are being  heard theon heard it  john heard it and so did ned now let's  bring this all the way back around to  the scene in which jon finds ghost  was it bloodraven who influenced this  event  was it jon's connection to ghost that  made him look back  again or was bran speaking to jon  through the wind rustling in the trees  john said he heard something  but what did he actually hear let me  know what you think down below  i want to thank everyone for watching  the video if you would like to support  the channel  head on over to my patreon i would  really appreciate that  the link is down below have a great day  everyone  i will see you again very soon bye  [Music]  [Music]  so  you
 

